<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Yêu thích | SHOPVN</title>

<link rel="icon" href="assets/images/logo/favicon.ico">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/responsive.css">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#f5f5f5;
color:#333;
}

a{
text-decoration:none;
color:inherit;
}

header{
background:#ee4d2d;
padding:16px 0;
color:#fff;
box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
position:sticky;
top:0;
z-index:999;
}

.header{
width:1200px;
max-width:95%;
margin:auto;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
}

.logo{
font-size:34px;
font-weight:900;
}

.nav{
display:flex;
gap:25px;
font-weight:500;
}

.container{
width:1200px;
max-width:95%;
margin:30px auto;
}

.title{
font-size:26px;
font-weight:900;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
gap:20px;
}

.card{
background:#fff;
border-radius:12px;
overflow:hidden;
box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.image{
height:220px;
overflow:hidden;
}

.image img{
width:100%;
height:100%;
object-fit:cover;
transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover img{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

.info{
padding:15px;
}

.name{
font-size:16px;
font-weight:700;
height:45px;
overflow:hidden;
}

.price{
margin-top:10px;
font-size:22px;
font-weight:900;
color:#ee4d2d;
}

.actions{
display:flex;
gap:10px;
margin-top:15px;
}

.btn{
flex:1;
padding:10px;
border:none;
border-radius:8px;
cursor:pointer;
font-weight:700;
transition:.3s;
}

.buy{
background:#ee4d2d;
color:#fff;
}

.buy:hover{
background:#d84324;
}

.remove{
background:#fff1ed;
color:#ee4d2d;
}

.remove:hover{
background:#ffd8cc;
}

.empty{
text-align:center;
padding:80px 20px;
color:#888;
}

.empty h2{
margin-top:15px;
}

footer{
margin-top:50px;
background:#fff;
padding:35px;
text-align:center;
color:#777;
}

@media(max-width:1000px){

.grid{
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
}

}

@media(max-width:600px){

.grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="header">

<div class="logo">SHOPVN</div>

<nav class="nav">

<a href="index.html">Trang chủ</a>

<a href="cart.html">Giỏ hàng</a>

<a href="profile.html">Tài khoản</a>

</nav>

</div>

</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="title">❤️ Sản phẩm yêu thích</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<div class="image">
<img src="assets/images/products/electronics/phone1.jpg">
</div>

<div class="info">

<div class="name">iPhone 16 Pro Max 256GB</div>

<div class="price">32.990.000₫</div>

<div class="actions">

<button class="btn buy">Mua ngay</button>

<button class="btn remove">Xóa</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="image">
<img src="assets/images/products/watch/watch1.jpg">
</div>

<div class="info">

<div class="name">Đồng hồ thông minh Ultra</div>

<div class="price">2.490.000₫</div>

<div class="actions">

<button class="btn buy">Mua ngay</button>

<button class="btn remove">Xóa</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="image">
<img src="assets/images/products/fashion/giay1.jpg">
</div>

<div class="info">

<div class="name">Giày Sneaker Nam Cao Cấp</div>

<div class="price">990.000₫</div>

<div class="actions">

<button class="btn buy">Mua ngay</button>

<button class="btn remove">Xóa</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="empty">
<h2>Nếu chưa có sản phẩm yêu thích</h2>
<p>Hãy thêm sản phẩm bạn muốn vào danh sách ❤️</p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>

© 2026 SHOPVN - Mua sắm hiện đại

</footer>

</body>

</html>